114 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Measuring Land Health is vital for progression towards more sustainable systems because it facilitates understanding the current impact of pressures on soils/biodiversity/ecosystems, and provides evidence on what interventions improve or reduce the status of land health. This is important to know for monitoring of interventions and when scaling to other regions. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
