/P 518 0 R
/ActualText (The majority of farmers across both clusters are smallholders. The scale of farming in the clusters means that shifting to sustainable practices could have a very large effect on land health at the landscape level. They influence soil quality at the site level, as well as biodiversity, and water quality and availability. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
